; pagsc.ca website records for Cloudflare (BIND format).
; Import: Cloudflare > pagsc.ca > DNS > Records > Import and Export > Import DNS records.
; Leave "Proxy imported DNS records" UNCHECKED: GitHub Pages needs these as DNS only.
; Mail records (MX, SPF) are not here: Email Routing adds its own.
$ORIGIN pagsc.ca.
$TTL 3600

; GitHub Pages, apex
@	IN	A	185.199.108.153
@	IN	A	185.199.109.153
@	IN	A	185.199.110.153
@	IN	A	185.199.111.153
@	IN	AAAA	2606:50c0:8000::153
@	IN	AAAA	2606:50c0:8001::153
@	IN	AAAA	2606:50c0:8002::153
@	IN	AAAA	2606:50c0:8003::153

; GitHub Pages, www (the canonical address)
www	IN	CNAME	ryanwoodie.github.io.
